      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a pretty strong critique, but I'm worried I'm giving the student a one-sided view. To help them improve their essay, shouldn't I also help them understand the strongest points of their own position? Like, what are the actual logical strengths or valid sociological arguments they are trying to make about social cohesion?",
